    'The charge is deductible in the subsidiary and taxable at the holdco, so it moves profit to where the tax is lower. '+
    'Anything above about '+ARMS_LENGTH+'% of revenue is more than an unrelated party would pay, and that is a position you have to defend.</div>';
  subs.forEach(function(r){
